<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34425" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπνευμᾰτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inflate</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				27.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.31
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>to be filled by the wind</i>, of sails, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cause flatulence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.54d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.173
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>suffer from flatulence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.833
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be asthmatic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.959
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>fill with the breath of life</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Leid.W.</u>
					7.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ θείου πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.966
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> intr., <i>to
				be inspired, show genius</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> Cit.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
